SUMMARY:Timmy No Brakes LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nTimmy No Brakes is one of stand-up comedy’s most electrifying rising stars\, known for his unhinged\, high-energy delivery and fearlessly unfiltered humor. His comedy style blends sharp observational wit with chaotic storytelling that keeps audiences on the edge of their seats — and laughing uncontrollably. \nWith a rapidly growing fanbase built through viral clips and relentless touring\, Timmy No Brakes has established himself as a must-see live act. His performances are raw\, unpredictable\, and packed with the kind of honest comedy that resonates deeply with audiences of all backgrounds. \nWhether you’ve been following him for years or are discovering him for the first time\, a Timmy No Brakes show is an experience you won’t forget. Expect big laughs\, big energy\, and zero brakes. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $38 – $54 \nAbout the Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s most beloved and storied comedy venues\, located in the heart of the North Beach neighborhood at 915 Columbus Avenue. With a capacity of around 400 guests\, Cobb’s offers an intimate yet lively atmosphere that puts every seat close to the stage. \nThe club features a full bar and dining service\, so you can enjoy food and drinks throughout the show. The room is set up with tables and chairs in a classic comedy club layout\, ensuring great sightlines from virtually every seat. Parking is available in nearby garages\, and the venue is easily accessible by public transit. \nCobb’s has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy over its decades-long history\, making it a legendary destination for stand-up fans in the Bay Area. The energy inside is always electric\, and the staff is known for creating a welcoming\, fun environment for every show. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Timmy No Brakes — a full evening of his signature brand of comedy. Expect a high-energy\, fast-paced show filled with hilarious stories\, sharp observations\, and moments of pure comedic chaos. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and is recommended for adult audiences. The 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage minimum are in effect\, so come ready to enjoy a drink (or two) while you laugh the night away. \nDoors typically open 30–45 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to grab a good seat and settle in before the laughs begin. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $38 – $54 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/timmy-no-brakes-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, California\, 94133\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/64cb3e72-3893-4871-8e8f-96f59daa2423_CUSTOM-HJmAW9.jpg
