SUMMARY:Gabriel Rutledge LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Gabriel Rutledge\nGabriel Rutledge is a nationally touring stand-up comedian with a reputation for being a quick-thinking\, fast-talking\, hard-working performer who consistently delivers. A past winner of both the prestigious Seattle International Comedy Competition and the Laughing Skull Comedy Festival in Atlanta\, Rutledge has established himself as one of the most reliable headliners on the comedy circuit. \nHis comedy style is sharp\, relatable\, and grounded in real life — drawing from marriage\, family\, and the everyday absurdities of modern existence. Gabriel has a gift for finding the funny in the mundane and turning it into comedy gold that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. \nGabriel has made numerous television appearances including Comedy Central’s Live at Gotham\, Nickelodeon’s Nickmom Night Out\, Laughs on FOX\, and Inside Joke streaming on Amazon Prime Video. His Dry Bar Comedy special “A Third of the Room” and his YouTube special “Nectarine” have garnered millions of views online. He is also the author of the book “Happiness Isn’t Funny: True Stories of a Road Comic.” \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM CDT\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: $20 – $25 (plus fees) \nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only minutes from the airport. The intimate club setting creates an electric atmosphere where every seat feels close to the action. \nThe venue features tiered seating sections including Preferred center-stage tables and General Admission side-stage tables — all first come\, first served within each section. The full-service bar lounge is the perfect place to grab a drink before the show\, and the two-item food or beverage minimum per person ensures a full dining experience during the performance. \nWith a capacity designed for an intimate comedy experience\, the Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club delivers a close-up\, personal show environment that larger arenas simply can’t match. Parking is available in the Park North Plaza lot. The venue enforces an 18% service charge on all checks in the showroom. \nWhat to Expect\nGabriel Rutledge’s live show is a masterclass in conversational stand-up comedy. His style is warm\, witty\, and deeply relatable — the kind of comedy that makes you feel like you’re hanging out with a hilarious friend who just happens to be incredibly funny. \nThis is a solo headlining performance in the intimate setting of the Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club. Expect sharp observations about everyday life\, marriage\, and the human condition delivered with impeccable timing and genuine charm. Gabriel’s award-winning comedy chops shine brightest in a club setting like this one. \nPlease note this is an 18+ event. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges. A two-item food or beverage minimum per person applies once seated. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $20 – $25 per ticket (plus fees)\nPreferred Seating (center stage): $25 (+fees)\nGeneral Admission (side stage): $20 (+fees) \nTickets are affordably priced for this award-winning comedian — grab yours before they sell out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gabriel-rutledge-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX\, 78216\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/53_Edp-20xlMZ.png
GEO:29.5193054;-98.5060363
