SUMMARY:Corey O'Brien: The Red Tour LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Corey O’Brien\nCorey O’Brien is a rising stand-up comedian known for his energetic delivery\, sharp wit\, and fearlessly honest material. His comedy draws from personal experiences and cultural observations\, delivered with a confident\, engaging style that keeps audiences laughing throughout. \nThe Red Tour is his latest stand-up tour\, featuring fresh material and the high-energy performance style that has earned him a growing fanbase across the country. Fans can expect a polished\, entertaining set full of clever comedy and genuine laughs. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is Northern California’s premier comedy destination. Located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, this legendary club has been the go-to spot for world-class stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe intimate setting features general admission and preferred premium seating\, a full bar\, and a classic two-drink minimum. The room holds a few hundred guests\, making every show feel personal and electric. Ample parking is available in the adjacent shopping center. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline performance of Corey O’Brien’s Red Tour. Additional shows are available July 8–9\, so check for your preferred time. Expect a high-energy\, laugh-packed evening of stand-up comedy. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $27 – $65 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/corey-obrien-the-red-tour-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, California\, 95825\, United States Of America
