SUMMARY:Liz Miele LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nLiz Miele LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club\nGet ready for a night of sharp\, witty\, and deeply relatable comedy as Liz Miele takes the stage at the legendary Punch Line Comedy Club in San Francisco. Known for her fearless storytelling and razor-sharp observations\, Liz delivers a stand-up experience that will have you laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\nAddress: 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2-item minimum per person \nAbout Liz Miele\nLiz Miele is a New York-based stand-up comedian known for her honest\, self-deprecating humor and energetic stage presence. She has appeared on Comedy Central\, AXS TV\, and released multiple acclaimed comedy specials. Her material covers everything from anxiety and relationships to the absurdities of everyday life\, earning her a devoted fanbase across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from one of the sharpest voices in the game\nHilarious takes on modern life\, relationships\, and personal quirks\nAn intimate club setting perfect for a great night out\nFull bar and food service available throughout the show\nGeneral admission seating — arrive early for the best spots\nA memorable evening of laughs in one of SF’s most iconic comedy venues\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco is one of the most storied comedy clubs in the country\, located in the heart of the Financial District at 444 Battery Street. The intimate setting ensures every seat is a great seat\, with a full bar and food service to enhance your experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at approximately $42 and go up to $132 depending on availability. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges unless the event is cancelled. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/liz-miele-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club/
