SUMMARY:Stamptown LIVE at The Bell House
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nStamptown at The Bell House\nNEW YORK TIMES TOP COMEDY PICK (2022). Stamptown is back at The Bell House! A raunchy\, chaotic\, and full-on fringe experience\, Stamptown is a late-night variety show featuring the best alternative performance from around the world. Hosted by the bad boy of clown\, Zach Zucker\, this show has sold out runs and packed rooms at Netflix Is A Joke\, Just For Laughs\, Glastonbury\, Edinburgh Fringe\, Soho Theatre\, Melbourne International Comedy Festival\, and off-Broadway in NYC. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nDoor Time: 7:00 PM | Show Time: 8:00 PM\nVenue: The Bell House\, 149 7th Street\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215\nAge Requirement: 21+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nSeating:\n\nAbout Stamptown\nStamptown is the brainchild of comedian and clown Zach Zucker. It’s a wild\, unpredictable variety show that brings together the best alternative comedians\, clowns\, and performers from around the globe. Every show is different\, every show is unforgettable. \nWhat to Expect\nA late-night comedy extravaganza featuring multiple performers\, physical comedy\, clowning\, and pure chaos. This is not your average stand-up show — Stamptown is an experience. \nVenue Information\nThe Bell House149 7th Street\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215By Subway: Take the F\, G or R Train to the Smith-9th Streets station. \nTicket Information\nTickets are $30.75 (all-inclusive pricing). There is an 8-ticket limit per order. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nDisclaimer: This post contains affiliate links. Purchasing tickets through our links helps support this site at no additional cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/stamptown-live-at-the-bell-house-2/
