SUMMARY:Christian Johnson LIVE at Milwaukee Improv (Main Room)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nChristian Johnson is a rising star in the stand-up comedy world\, best known for his viral character “Uncle Nathaniel” — the lovably dramatic\, over-the-top relative we all have in our family. His catchphrase “Lord Have Mer-Say” has taken the internet by storm\, earning him over 2.5 million followers across social media platforms. \nKnown for his refreshing clean comedy\, contagious energy\, and unique storytelling style\, Christian Johnson brings a high-energy performance that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. He has shared the stage with countless celebrity comics and has toured nationally and internationally\, cementing his place as one of the most exciting comedians to watch right now. \nExpect relatable humor\, hilarious character work\, and a show that will have you quoting lines long after you leave the venue. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM CDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Milwaukee Improv (Main Room)\nAddress: 20110 Lower Union Street\, Brookfield\, WI 53045\nAge Restriction: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nContent: Clean comedy — suitable for all adult audiences\n\nPlease note: There is a mandatory two-item minimum purchase per person in the showroom. No cell phone use\, photography\, or video recording is permitted during the performance. All sales are final. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Milwaukee Improv (Main Room) is one of the premier comedy clubs in the Midwest\, located at 20110 Lower Union Street in Brookfield\, Wisconsin — just minutes west of downtown Milwaukee. Part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, the Milwaukee Improv has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy. \nThe Main Room features a classic comedy club atmosphere with general admission seating\, premium booths\, and VIP options. The venue has a full-service bar and kitchen\, with a two-item minimum per guest in the showroom. Seating is first-come\, first-served for general admission\, with reserved options available for groups and premium booth holders. \nThe club has a capacity that creates an intimate\, up-close experience with the performer — perfect for a night of laughs. Parking is available on-site at the venue. The atmosphere is lively and welcoming\, making it a great destination for date nights\, group outings\, or solo comedy fans. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up comedy show featuring Christian Johnson as the headliner. Expect a full evening of high-energy\, clean stand-up comedy with Christian’s signature character work\, viral bits\, and crowd interaction. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes including any opening acts. Doors open at 5:30 PM\, so arrive early to grab your seats and enjoy the full experience. The intimate setting of the Milwaukee Improv Main Room means every seat is a great seat — you’ll feel like you’re right in the middle of the action. \nThis is a 21+ event\, so bring a valid photo ID. The two-item minimum applies to all guests in the showroom\, so plan to enjoy food and drinks while you laugh the night away. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $25 – $90 (plus fees) \n\nGA Ticket: $25 (+ fees)\nVIP Ticket: $40 (+ fees)\nGA Booth for 4: $75/ticket (+ fees) — includes $200 food & beverage credit\nVIP Premium Booth for 4: $90/ticket (+ fees) — includes $200 food & beverage credit\n\nGet your tickets now before they sell out — only limited seats remain! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/christian-johnson-live-at-milwaukee-improv/
LOCATION:Milwaukee Improv (Main Room)\, 20110 Lower Union Street\, Brookfield\, WI\, 53045\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://i.ticketweb.com/i/00/12/74/32/44_Edp.jpg?v=3
GEO:43.0353362;-88.1627026
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Milwaukee Improv (Main Room) 20110 Lower Union Street Brookfield WI 53045 USA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=20110 Lower Union Street:geo:-88.1627026,43.0353362
END:VEVENT
