SUMMARY:Adam Carolla LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nAdam Carolla is a multi-hyphenate entertainer — stand-up comedian\, podcast pioneer\, author\, and television personality — best known for his sharp\, opinionated humor and rapid-fire delivery. \nHe rose to fame as co-host of Loveline and The Man Show\, and later became a podcasting legend with The Adam Carolla Show\, which held the Guinness World Record for most downloaded podcast. \nCarolla’s stand-up is unapologetically direct\, blending personal anecdotes\, social commentary\, and blue-collar wisdom into a high-energy performance that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (doors open earlier)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: From $49\n\nAbout the Venue\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is one of the premier comedy destinations on the Las Vegas Strip\, located on the iconic LINQ Promenade at 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nThe intimate venue seats approximately 300 guests and features a state-of-the-art sound system\, excellent sightlines from every seat\, and full bar service throughout the show. \nThe club’s cozy atmosphere creates an up-close-and-personal comedy experience unlike the large arena shows Vegas is known for. Parking is available at the LINQ Hotel parking garage\, and the venue is easily accessible via the Las Vegas Monorail. \nThe LINQ Promenade itself offers a variety of dining and entertainment options before and after the show\, making it a perfect evening destination on the Strip. \nWhat to Expect\nAdam Carolla delivers a headline solo stand-up performance filled with his trademark rapid-fire wit\, personal stories\, and unfiltered takes on modern life. \nExpect a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud show where Carolla’s natural charisma and decades of comedic experience shine through. His sets are known for their conversational flow and ability to make even controversial topics hilarious. \nThis is a must-see for fans of smart\, opinionated comedy in an intimate Las Vegas club setting. Arrive early to grab a drink and the best seats in the house. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $49 and are available through official and resale channels. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/adam-carolla-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-comedy-club-2/
