SUMMARY:Dave Smith LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Dave Smith\nDave Smith is a stand-up comedian who channels headline-level clarity into club-ready punchlines\, building high-velocity sets that fuse political curiosity\, off-the-cuff crowd play\, and meticulous craft. Known for taking apart hot-button ideas and inviting the audience into the argument\, Dave sticks the landing with tags that cut and charm in equal measure. \nHis onstage voice is candid and quick — the kind that can pivot from a precise premise to a fearless riff without losing control. He released his comedy special Libertas in 2017 and has been a fixture on the national comedy circuit ever since. If you want jokes that interrogate the moment without losing the laugh\, Dave Smith delivers heat\, wit\, and a surprising amount of heart. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price: From $28 \nAbout Punch Line Houston\nPunch Line Houston is downtown Houston’s premier stand-up comedy club\, located at 1204 Caroline Street. Part of the nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this intimate venue delivers an up-close comedy experience that puts you right in the action. \nThe club features table seating\, a full-service bar\, and a two-drink minimum. The intimate setting is ideal for Dave’s sharp\, thought-provoking comedy style. Parking is available in nearby downtown Houston garages. \nWhat to Expect\nDave Smith’s live show is a masterclass in political and observational comedy. He builds arguments like a lawyer and delivers punchlines like a pro — every set is tight\, fast\, and packed with ideas that make you think as much as they make you laugh. Expect crowd interaction\, fearless takes\, and a room that’s fully engaged from the first minute. \nDave is performing a full weekend run at Punch Line Houston — Thursday July 9 at 7:30 PM\, Friday July 10 at 7:00 PM and 9:15 PM\, and Saturday July 11 at 7:00 PM. This is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum per guest. \nTicket Information\nPrice: From $28\nTickets available via Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/dave-smith-live-at-punch-line-houston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
