SUMMARY:Pete Holmes: Pete Here Now LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Pete Holmes\nPete Holmes is one of comedy’s most beloved performers — a comedian\, actor\, writer\, and podcaster known for his HBO semi-autobiographical series “Crashing\,” his long-running podcast “You Made It Weird\,” and multiple acclaimed stand-up specials including “Faces and Sounds” and “Dirty Clean.” \nHis comedy is warm\, philosophical\, and deeply funny\, blending personal storytelling with big ideas about life\, spirituality\, and human connection. “Pete Here Now” is his latest tour\, promising a fresh hour of material that showcases Pete at his most present and hilarious. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is the crown jewel of Northern California’s comedy scene. Located at 2100 Arden Way\, this storied venue has welcomed the biggest names in stand-up for decades. The intimate club-style layout ensures an up-close\, personal experience with the performer. \nThe full bar\, two-drink minimum\, and warm atmosphere make for a classic comedy night out. Additional shows are available July 10–11\, so there are plenty of options to catch Pete Holmes live. Parking is available in the surrounding shopping center lot. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline performance of Pete Holmes’ “Pete Here Now” tour. Expect a warm\, funny\, and thought-provoking evening of stand-up comedy from one of the genre’s most unique voices. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $44 – $80 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/pete-holmes-pete-here-now-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
