SUMMARY:Dulcé Sloan LIVE at Punch Line Irving
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nDulcé Sloan is one of the most exciting voices in stand-up comedy today. Known for her bold\, unapologetic humor and razor-sharp wit\, she has become a fan favorite on the comedy circuit and a recognizable face on television. \nSloan is best known as a correspondent on Comedy Central’s The Daily Show\, where her fearless commentary and comedic timing have earned her widespread acclaim. Her stand-up style blends personal storytelling\, social commentary\, and high-energy delivery that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nWith a background rooted in Atlanta’s vibrant comedy scene\, Dulcé brings an authentic Southern perspective to her material. She tackles topics ranging from race and gender to everyday absurdities of modern life — all with a confidence and charisma that is entirely her own. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM \nVenue: Punch Line Irving\, 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX 75039 \nAge Restriction: 18+ with 2-beverage minimum \nAdditional Dates: Also performing July 10 (7:00 PM & 9:15 PM) and July 11 (7:00 PM & 9:15 PM) \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Irving is one of the Dallas-Fort Worth area’s premier comedy clubs\, located in the heart of the Las Colinas entertainment district in Irving\, Texas. Part of the nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this venue offers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere perfect for experiencing stand-up comedy up close. \nThe club features a full bar and dining service\, with a 2-beverage minimum per guest. The seating is general admission style\, giving audiences a relaxed and social environment to enjoy the show. The venue is conveniently located near the Toyota Music Factory entertainment complex\, with ample parking available in the surrounding area. \nWith a capacity designed for an up-close comedy experience\, Punch Line Irving ensures every seat has a great view of the stage. The venue regularly hosts nationally touring headliners and is a must-visit destination for comedy fans in the DFW metroplex. \nWhat to Expect\nDulcé Sloan’s live show is a high-energy\, no-holds-barred comedy experience. Expect sharp observations\, hilarious personal anecdotes\, and the kind of fearless humor that has made her one of the most talked-about comedians working today. \nThe show runs approximately 75–90 minutes and is intended for adult audiences (18+). Guests are encouraged to arrive early to secure good seats\, enjoy dinner and drinks\, and settle in before the show begins. The 2-beverage minimum is included in the ticket price. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan of her work on The Daily Show or discovering Dulcé Sloan for the first time\, this is a live comedy experience you won’t want to miss. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $27 – $50 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Purchase early as shows at Punch Line Irving sell out quickly. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/dulce-sloan-live-at-punch-line-irving/
LOCATION:Punch Line Irving\, 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX\, 75039\, United States Of America
