SUMMARY:Luenell LIVE at Arlington Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nLuenell LIVE at Arlington Improv\nOne of comedy’s most beloved and outrageous performers is coming to Arlington! Luenell\, the actress and stand-up comedian known for her unforgettable roles in Borat\, A Star Is Born\, and Hotel Transylvania\, brings her hilarious live show to Arlington Improv on July 9\, 2026. Expect big laughs\, big personality\, and a night you won’t forget! \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Arlington Improv\nAddress: 309 Curtis Mathes Way #147\, Arlington\, TX 76018\nAge Requirement: 18+ \nAbout Luenell\nLuenell is a stand-up comedian and actress best known for her scene-stealing roles in Borat: Cultural Learnings of America for Make Benefit Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan\, A Star Is Born (2018)\, and the Hotel Transylvania franchise. She has appeared on Chelsea Lately\, The Tonight Show\, and numerous other TV programs. Her raw\, unfiltered comedy style has made her a fan favorite across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious\, no-holds-barred stand-up comedy from a Hollywood fan favorite\nOutrageous storytelling and crowd interaction\nAn intimate comedy club experience at Arlington Improv\nA night packed with non-stop laughs\nFull bar service available\n\nVenue Information\nArlington Improv is located at 309 Curtis Mathes Way #147 in Arlington\, TX\, conveniently situated in the Dallas-Fort Worth metroplex. This premier comedy club offers an intimate setting with full bar service and is one of the top comedy destinations in the DFW area. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available now through Ticketmaster. This is an 18+ event. Grab your seats before they sell out — Luenell always draws a crowd! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/luenell-live-at-arlington-improv/
