SUMMARY:Corey O'Brien: The Red Tour LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nCorey O’Brien: The Red Tour LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Club\nRising stand-up comedian Corey O’Brien brings his highly anticipated The Red Tour to San Francisco’s legendary Cobb’s Comedy Club on Thursday\, July 9\, 2026. Known for his sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and infectious energy\, Corey O’Brien is one of the most exciting voices in comedy today. Don’t miss this unforgettable night of laughs in the heart of San Francisco. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person\nParking: Street parking available; garages nearby \nAbout Corey O’Brien\nCorey O’Brien is a fast-rising stand-up comedian celebrated for his clever observations\, self-deprecating humor\, and high-energy performances. With a growing fanbase built through social media and live touring\, Corey has established himself as a must-see act on the comedy circuit. The Red Tour marks a major milestone in his career\, bringing his best material to audiences across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of original stand-up comedy from Corey O’Brien\nSharp\, relatable humor covering everyday life and modern absurdities\nAn intimate club setting at one of SF’s most iconic comedy venues\nHigh-energy performance with crowd interaction\nSpecial opening act to warm up the crowd\nA night you’ll be talking about long after the show\n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in San Francisco’s North Beach neighborhood\, is one of the premier comedy clubs on the West Coast. With a capacity of around 400\, it offers an intimate yet electric atmosphere perfect for live stand-up comedy. The club features full bar service and a two-beverage minimum per guest. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $38.20 for General Admission. This is an 18+ event — valid photo ID is required for entry. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale marketplace). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/corey-obrien-the-red-tour-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
