DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nSeth Meyers: Live LIVE at OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nEmmy Award-winning comedian\, writer\, and television host Seth Meyers brings his stand-up comedy show to the OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino in Niagara Falls. Best known as the host of Late Night with Seth Meyers on NBC\, he delivers sharp political humor and hilarious observations. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\nAddress: 6366 Stanley Ave\, Niagara Falls\, ON L2G 3Y5 \nAbout Seth Meyers\nSeth Meyers is a comedian\, writer\, actor\, and television host best known for hosting Late Night with Seth Meyers on NBC. He was previously the head writer and Weekend Update anchor on Saturday Night Live. His stand-up comedy is sharp\, witty\, and politically astute. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp political humor and cultural commentary\nHilarious observations from a Late Night legend\nA world-class venue experience at Fallsview Casino\nStunning Niagara Falls backdrop\nAn unforgettable night of comedy\n\nVenue Information\nThe OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino is a premier entertainment venue at 6366 Stanley Ave in Niagara Falls\, Ontario. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $64. Get your seats now! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
