SUMMARY:Patrick Warburton LIVE at Laugh Factory Las Vegas
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nPatrick Warburton is a beloved actor and comedian best known for his iconic roles as David Puddy on Seinfeld\, Joe Swanson on Family Guy\, and Kronk in The Emperor’s New Groove. With his distinctive deep voice and deadpan delivery\, Warburton has become one of the most recognizable comedic presences in Hollywood. \nOn stage\, Patrick brings the same dry wit and effortless charm that has made him a fan favorite on screen. His stand-up comedy is observational\, self-deprecating\, and delivered with the kind of confident timing that only comes from decades of performing. Audiences love his ability to find humor in everyday situations while maintaining his signature larger-than-life persona. \nSeeing Patrick Warburton live at the Laugh Factory in Las Vegas is a rare treat — an opportunity to experience one of Hollywood’s most beloved comedic talents in an intimate club setting. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nTime: 6:30 PM\nVenue: Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas is one of the most storied comedy club brands in the world\, bringing its legendary Hollywood comedy experience to the heart of the Las Vegas Strip. Located inside the iconic Horseshoe Las Vegas at 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, this venue has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy. \nThe club features a classic comedy club layout with tiered seating\, excellent sightlines\, and a full bar service. The intimate atmosphere creates a personal connection between performer and audience that larger venues simply can’t replicate. With a capacity of several hundred guests\, every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe Horseshoe Las Vegas is conveniently located on the Strip with easy access to parking and public transportation. The venue is a must-visit for comedy fans looking for a world-class show in a classic club setting. \nWhat to Expect\nPatrick Warburton’s Las Vegas show is a stand-up performance showcasing his signature deadpan humor\, Hollywood stories\, and sharp observational comedy. Expect an evening filled with laughs from start to finish\, delivered by a performer who has been making audiences laugh for decades. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and may include an opening act. The intimate setting of the Laugh Factory creates an electric atmosphere where Patrick’s natural charisma and comedic timing shine brightest. Fans of his TV and film work will love seeing a different\, more personal side of this comedy legend. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $40 – $74 (fees may apply) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale marketplace). Patrick Warburton shows are popular — book early to secure your seats! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/patrick-warburton-live-at-laugh-factory-las-vegas/
LOCATION:Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
